..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : SPEDAUO.TAB.PRINTPARAM
.. Autor          : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      : fwester
.. Funktion       : Steuerparameter fuer Sammeldruck der Speditionspapiere
.. Functionality  : Control parameter for collective print of shipping papers
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. default customers: print shipping order, goods receipt/issue slip, labels
.formula M|tprintparam = "STD"
..
..
.. .. use TSB tool version 2 for "Transport- and Sendungsbelege", print standard labels
.. .formula M|tprintparam = "VW"         ?  M|tcustomer^firma^frbez="123456789"
..
.. .. use TSB tool version 3 for "Transport- and Sendungsbelege", print standard labels
.. .formula M|tprintparam = "VW-TSB"     ?  M|tcustomer^firma^frbez="123456789"
..
.. .. use TSB tool version 3 for "Global Transport Labels", print standard shipping orders
.. .formula M|tprintparam = "VW-GTL"     ?  M|tcustomer^firma^frbez="123456789"
..
.. .. use TSB tool version 3 for "Transport- and Sendungsbelege" and "Global Transport Labels"
.. .formula M|tprintparam = "VW-TSB-GTL" ?  M|tcustomer^firma^frbez="123456789"
..
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
